#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:4
msgid "Facilitator"
msgstr "Facilitator"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:6
msgid ""
"Every hub is an `x402 <https://x402.org/>`_ facilitator for its own "
"credit ledger. A merchant that has asked for payment in credit sends the "
"buyer's signed authorization to the hub, which verifies it, moves the "
"credit between two accounts and returns a signed receipt. This page "
"describes what the facilitator does, which requests it answers, how it "
"fails, and the operator's tasks around the ledger. The payer's and "
"payee's side of a payment is described in :ref:`topics-payments`."
msgstr ""
"每个 hub 都是其自身额度账本的 `x402 <https://x402.org/>`_ "
"facilitator。要求以额度付款的商家,会把买方签名的授权发送给 hub;hub "
"验证授权,在两个账户之间转移额度,并返回带签名的收据。本页说明 facilitator "
"的职责、它应答的请求、失败的方式,以及运维人员围绕账本的各项工作。付款方与收款方一侧的流程见 :ref:`topics-payments`\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:20
msgid "What the facilitator does"
msgstr "facilitator 的职责"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:22
msgid ""
"The x402 specification permits a resource server to host its own "
"facilitator endpoints. For a ledger rail there is nothing to separate: "
"the balances are in the hub's database. A hub therefore serves the three "
"facilitator endpoints itself."
msgstr ""
"x402 规范允许资源服务器自行托管 facilitator 端点。对于账本这种支付通道,没有需要分离的部分:余额就在 hub 的数据库中。因此 "
"hub 自己提供三个 facilitator 端点。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:27
msgid "Scheme and network"
msgstr "方案与网络"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:28
msgid ""
"The scheme is ``anet-credit`` and the asset is ``credit``. The network is"
" ``hub:<AID of the hub>``, so two hubs are two networks. An authorization"
" signed for one hub's network cannot be settled on another."
msgstr ""
"方案为 ``anet-credit``,资产为 ``credit``\\ 。网络为 ``hub:<hub 的 AID>``,所以两个 hub "
"即是两个网络。为某个 hub 的网络签名的授权,不能在另一个 hub 上结算。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:32
msgid "Amounts"
msgstr "金额"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:33
msgid ""
"Credits are whole numbers. An amount must be between 1 and 2\\ "
":sup:`63`\\ −1; zero and larger values are refused."
msgstr "额度以整数计。金额必须在 1 到 2\\ :sup:`63`\\ −1 之间;零和更大的值均会被拒绝。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:36
msgid "Custody"
msgstr "托管"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:37
msgid ""
"On a blockchain a facilitator holds no funds. This one does: the hub "
"keeps the balances and is therefore their custodian, and a node that "
"registers with a hub chooses to trust it with them. What the hub cannot "
"do is rewrite what happened. The payer signs the authorization, the hub "
"signs the receipt, and each party keeps both on its own evidence chain. "
"The balance is the hub's record; the proof of the payment is the "
"parties'."
msgstr ""
"在区块链上,facilitator 不持有资金。这里的 facilitator 则持有:余额由 hub 保管,hub 因此是余额的托管方,向 "
"hub 注册的节点即选择了将余额托付给它。hub 无法做到的是改写已发生的事实。授权由付款方签名,收据由 hub "
"签名,双方各自在自己的证据链上保存两者。余额是 hub 的记录;付款的证明则属于双方。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:44
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "可见范围"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:45
msgid ""
"At the moment of settlement the hub sees the payer, the payee, the amount"
" and the time. It sees no task content. The ledger detail is kept for 14 "
"days (see :ref:`ops-facilitator-window`)."
msgstr ""
"结算时,hub 能看到付款方、收款方、金额和时间,看不到任务内容。账本明细保留 14 天(参见 :ref:`ops-facilitator-"
"window`)。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:51
msgid "Endpoints"
msgstr "端点"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:57 ../../ops/facilitator.rst:301
msgid "Route"
msgstr "路由"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:58
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:59
msgid "``GET /x402/supported``"
msgstr "``GET /x402/supported``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:60
msgid ""
"The scheme and network pairs the hub settles, the extensions it "
"implements, and where each signer's key history is served."
msgstr "hub 结算的方案与网络组合、已实现的扩展,以及各签名者密钥历史的提供位置。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:62
msgid "``POST /x402/verify``"
msgstr "``POST /x402/verify``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:63
msgid "Check whether an authorization would settle, without moving credit."
msgstr "检查某份授权能否结算,不转移额度。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:64
msgid "``POST /x402/settle``"
msgstr "``POST /x402/settle``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:65
msgid "Settle an authorization and return the receipt."
msgstr "结算授权并返回收据。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:66
msgid "``POST /x402/redeem``"
msgstr "``POST /x402/redeem``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:67
msgid "Take credit out of circulation (see :ref:`ops-facilitator-redeem`)."
msgstr "将额度退出流通(参见 :ref:`ops-facilitator-redeem`)。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:68
msgid "``POST /fed/v3/settle``"
msgstr "``POST /fed/v3/settle``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:69
msgid ""
"The same settlement, requested by a peer hub on behalf of its merchant; "
"signed by that peer (see :ref:`ops-federation`)."
msgstr "同样的结算,由对等 hub 代表其商家发起,并由该对等方签名(参见 :ref:`ops-federation`)。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:71
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``GET /agents/{aid}/balance``, ``GET /agents/{aid}/ledger``, ``GET "
"/agents/{aid}/redemptions``"
msgstr ""
"``GET /agents/{aid}/balance``\\ 、\\ ``GET /agents/{aid}/ledger``\\ 、\\ "
"``GET /agents/{aid}/redemptions``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:73
msgid ""
"An account's own balance, entries and redemptions. The request must be "
"signed by the AID in the path; any other caller receives ``401``."
msgstr "账户自身的余额、条目和兑付记录。请求必须由路径中的 AID 签名;其他任何调用方均收到 ``401``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:76
msgid ""
"The former resource gateway at ``/x402/resource/`` is removed and answers"
" ``410 gateway_removed``. Payment takes place inside a task, between "
"nodes, through the a2a-x402 extension; there is no longer a hub endpoint "
"that fronts an HTTP resource."
msgstr ""
"原先位于 ``/x402/resource/`` 的资源网关已移除,现返回 ``410 gateway_removed``\\ "
"。付款在任务之内、节点之间,通过 a2a-x402 扩展完成;hub 上不再有代理 HTTP 资源的端点。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:82
msgid "Supported networks"
msgstr "支持的网络"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:103
msgid ""
"The first entry is always the hub's own network. Each further entry is a "
"federation peer whose ledger this hub will clear against, so that a "
"seller priced on this hub can be paid by a buyer whose credit lives on "
"the peer. ``anet.signer_kel`` tells a reader where to obtain the key "
"history that a receipt is verified against."
msgstr ""
"第一项始终是 hub 自身的网络。其后每一项是一个联邦对等方,本 hub 会与其账本清算,使得以本 hub "
"定价的卖方可以收到额度存放在该对等方上的买方的付款。\\ ``anet.signer_kel`` 告知读取方到哪里获取用于验证收据的密钥历史。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:110
msgid "Verify and settle"
msgstr "验证与结算"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:112
msgid ""
"Both routes take the x402 version 2 body. ``paymentRequirements`` is "
"required: without it the hub could not compare the authorization with the"
" terms the merchant quoted, and it would settle whatever the payer "
"signed."
msgstr ""
"两个路由都接受 x402 第 2 版的请求体。\\ ``paymentRequirements`` 为必填:缺少它时,hub "
"无法将授权与商家报出的条款比对,只能对付款方签名的任何内容照单结算。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:140
msgid ""
"The signed authorization is produced by the payer's node; it holds the "
"payer, payee, amount, network, a nonce, the validity window and the "
"binding to the task. Operators do not normally construct one."
msgstr "已签名的授权由付款方的节点生成,其中包含付款方、收款方、金额、网络、随机数、有效期窗口,以及与任务的绑定。运维人员通常不需要自行构造。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:144
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``/x402/verify`` answers ``200`` with ``{\"isValid\": true, \"payer\": "
"\"...\"}`` or ``{\"isValid\": false, \"invalidReason\": \"<reason>\"}``. "
"A body that cannot be read answers ``400`` with the same shape."
msgstr ""
"``/x402/verify`` 返回 ``200``,正文为 ``{\"isValid\": true, \"payer\": "
"\"...\"}`` 或 ``{\"isValid\": false, \"invalidReason\": \"<reason>\"}``\\ "
"。无法读取的请求体返回 ``400``,正文形式相同。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:148
msgid ""
"``/x402/settle`` answers ``200`` with a settlement response, also when "
"the settlement is refused:"
msgstr "``/x402/settle`` 返回 ``200`` 和一份结算响应,结算被拒绝时亦然:"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:164
msgid ""
"A refusal has ``\"success\": false`` and an ``errorReason`` from the "
"table below. Prose detail, where there is any, is placed under the "
"extension ``anet.error_detail``. Callers branch on the reason, not on the"
" prose."
msgstr ""
"拒绝的响应带有 ``\"success\": false`` 和取自下表的 ``errorReason``\\ 。如有文字说明,则置于扩展 "
"``anet.error_detail`` 之下。调用方应依据原因码分支处理,而不是依据文字说明。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:168
msgid ""
"Settling is idempotent on the authorization. Presenting an authorization "
"that has already been settled returns the original receipt with the "
"extension ``anet.replayed`` set to ``true``; nothing moves a second time."
msgstr ""
"结算对同一授权是幂等的。重复提交已结算的授权,会返回原收据,并将扩展 ``anet.replayed`` 设为 "
"``true``;不会再次转移任何额度。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:173
msgid "Receipts"
msgstr "收据"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:175
msgid ""
"Every successful settlement carries a receipt signed by the hub whose "
"ledger the network names: the authorization id, payer, payee, amount, "
"network and settlement time. A node verifies it against the key history "
"served at the URL in ``anet.signer_kel``, and the receipt stays valid "
"without asking the hub. A hub signs receipts only for its own network."
msgstr ""
"每次成功的结算都附有一份收据,由网络所指定的账本所属 hub 签名,内容包括授权 ID、付款方、收款方、金额、网络和结算时间。节点依据 "
"``anet.signer_kel`` 中 URL 提供的密钥历史验证收据,此后收据无需再询问 hub 即保持有效。hub "
"只为自身的网络签发收据。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:183
msgid "Reasons"
msgstr "原因码"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:189
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "原因码"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:190
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:191
msgid "``insufficient_funds``"
msgstr "``insufficient_funds``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:192
msgid "The payer's balance does not cover the amount."
msgstr "付款方的余额不足以支付该金额。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:193
msgid "``invalid_signature``"
msgstr "``invalid_signature``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:194
msgid ""
"The authorization does not verify against the payer's key history, or it "
"was signed over different terms."
msgstr "授权无法通过付款方密钥历史的验证,或其签名所针对的条款不同。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:196
msgid "``expired_payment``"
msgstr "``expired_payment``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:197
msgid ""
"The authorization is presented outside its validity window, or it has no "
"valid window. A tolerance of two minutes applies to the clock difference "
"between payer and hub."
msgstr "授权在有效期窗口之外提交,或没有有效的窗口。付款方与 hub 之间的时钟差允许两分钟的容差。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:200
msgid "``auth_window_too_long``"
msgstr "``auth_window_too_long``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:201
msgid ""
"The window between issue and expiry is longer than 24 hours. A long-lived"
" authorization is a standing bearer instrument, and the hub does not "
"honour one. Nodes sign authorizations valid for five minutes."
msgstr "签发到过期之间的窗口超过 24 小时。长期有效的授权相当于一直有效的持票凭证,hub 不予承兑。节点签发的授权有效期为五分钟。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:204
msgid "``unknown_payer``"
msgstr "``unknown_payer``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:205
msgid "The hub holds no account for the payer."
msgstr "hub 没有该付款方的账户。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:206
msgid "``network_mismatch``"
msgstr "``network_mismatch``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:207
msgid ""
"The authorization is signed for another ledger, or is offered on a "
"network other than the one the requirements name."
msgstr "授权是为另一个账本签名的,或提交所用的网络与要求中指明的网络不一致。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:209
msgid "``malformed_payment``"
msgstr "``malformed_payment``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:210
msgid "The payload cannot be read as an authorization."
msgstr "载荷无法解析为授权。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:211
msgid "``unsupported_scheme``"
msgstr "``unsupported_scheme``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:212
msgid ""
"The payload or the requirements name a scheme other than ``anet-credit``,"
" or name two different schemes."
msgstr "载荷或要求中指明了 ``anet-credit`` 之外的方案,或指明了两种不同的方案。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:214
msgid "``invalid_amount``"
msgstr "``invalid_amount``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:215
msgid ""
"The authorized amount is below the required amount, differs from the "
"amount the payload accepted, or is not a whole number of units."
msgstr "授权金额低于要求的金额,与载荷所接受的金额不一致,或不是整数个单位。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:217
msgid "``payee_mismatch``"
msgstr "``payee_mismatch``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:218
msgid "The authorization pays someone other than the required payee."
msgstr "授权支付给了要求的收款方之外的人。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:219
msgid "``invalid_payment_requirements``"
msgstr "``invalid_payment_requirements``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:220
msgid "The request carried no ``paymentRequirements``, or they cannot be read."
msgstr "请求未带 ``paymentRequirements``,或其无法解析。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:222
msgid "``duplicate_nonce``"
msgstr "``duplicate_nonce``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:223
msgid ""
"The exact authorization was already settled (returned by "
"``/x402/verify``; ``/x402/settle`` returns the original receipt)."
msgstr "完全相同的授权已被结算(由 ``/x402/verify`` 返回;\\ ``/x402/settle`` 返回原收据)。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:225
msgid "``duplicate_binding``"
msgstr "``duplicate_binding``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:226
msgid ""
"A different authorization from the same payer was already settled for the"
" same task. Nothing moved; the original transaction is named in the "
"extension ``anet.original_transaction``."
msgstr "同一付款方针对同一任务的另一份授权已被结算。未发生任何转移;原交易在扩展 ``anet.original_transaction`` 中给出。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:229
msgid "``payee_not_local``"
msgstr "``payee_not_local``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:230
msgid ""
"The payee is neither an account of this hub nor the hub itself. "
"Settlements for a payee on another hub go through that hub (see below)."
msgstr "收款方既不是本 hub 的账户,也不是 hub 本身。向其他 hub 上收款方的结算,须经由该 hub 办理(见下文)。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:233
msgid "``settlement_pending``"
msgstr "``settlement_pending``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:234
msgid "The outcome is not known yet. Not final: retry with the same payload."
msgstr "结果尚未确定。这不是最终状态:请以相同的载荷重试。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:235
msgid "``settlement_failed``"
msgstr "``settlement_failed``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:236
msgid ""
"The hub could not complete the settlement for a reason not listed above, "
"such as a storage error."
msgstr "hub 因上述未列出的原因(例如存储错误)无法完成结算。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:240
msgid "Settlement for accounts on another hub"
msgstr "向其他 hub 上账户的结算"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:242
msgid ""
"An authorization names the ledger it spends. A merchant whose account is "
"on hub A, but whose buyer holds credit on hub B, sends the settlement to "
"hub A. Hub A first compares the payment with the requirements and checks "
"that the payee is one of its accounts. It then forwards the request, "
"signed with its own identity, to hub B's ``POST /fed/v3/settle``. Hub B "
"verifies the signature and compares the terms again, settles on its "
"ledger and returns a receipt. Hub A checks that the receipt states the "
"required payee and amount, credits the payee, and records what hub B now "
"owes it. Hub A does not forward a settlement unless hub B is in its peer "
"table."
msgstr ""
"授权会指明它所动用的账本。商家的账户在 hub A 上、买方的额度在 hub B 上时,商家把结算请求发给 hub A。hub A "
"首先将付款与要求比对,并确认收款方是自己的账户;然后把请求以自身身份签名,转发到 hub B 的 ``POST "
"/fed/v3/settle``\\ 。hub B 验证签名并再次比对条款,在其账本上结算并返回收据。hub A "
"核对收据中载明的收款方和金额符合要求,为收款方入账,并记录 hub B 此时欠自己的数额。hub B 不在 hub A 的对等方表中时,hub A"
" 不会转发结算。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:252
msgid ""
"The outcome can be unknown to hub A: the peer may not have answered, or "
"may have settled without hub A learning of it. Hub A then answers "
"``settlement_pending``. The merchant retries with the same payload; hub B"
" returns its original receipt for an authorization it has settled, so the"
" retry completes the clearing and the payee is credited once. A refusal "
"the peer gives before its ledger saw the request (the peer does not list "
"hub A, the signature was not accepted, or the request was stale) is known"
" not to have settled and is reported as ``settlement_failed`` with what "
"the peer said. A network that belongs to no listed peer is refused with "
"``network_mismatch``."
msgstr ""
"hub A 可能无法得知结果:对等方可能没有应答,或已完成结算而 hub A 未获知。此时 hub A 返回 "
"``settlement_pending``\\ 。商家以相同的载荷重试;对于已结算的授权,hub B "
"会返回其原收据,因此重试可完成清算,且收款方只入账一次。对等方在其账本见到请求之前给出的拒绝(对等方未列出 hub "
"A、签名未被接受,或请求已过期),可确知并未结算,以 ``settlement_failed`` "
"上报,并附上对等方所说明的内容。不属于任何已列对等方的网络,以 ``network_mismatch`` 拒绝。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:266
msgid "The ledger"
msgstr "账本"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:268
msgid ""
"Credit exists only because the hub issues it. Each issuance debits the "
"hub's own account by the same amount, so the entries of the whole ledger "
"sum to zero and the amount the hub owes its users is the negative of the "
"hub's own balance. Credit is created in three ways only:"
msgstr ""
"额度之所以存在,仅因为 hub 发行了它。每次发行都会以相同金额借记 hub 自身的账户,因此整个账本的条目之和为零,hub 欠用户的数额等于 "
"hub 自身余额的相反数。额度只有三种产生方式:"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:273
msgid "an operator grant (``anet-hub grant``);"
msgstr "运维人员发放(``anet-hub grant``);"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:274
msgid ""
"the grant that can accompany an admission (``anet-hub admit --grant``), "
"paid when the AID first registers;"
msgstr "随准入附带的发放(``anet-hub admit --grant``),在该 AID 首次注册时支付;"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:276
msgid ""
"the 20 trial credits paid when an account on probation completes its 72 "
"hours (see :ref:`ops-hub-admission`)."
msgstr "处于试用期的账户满 72 小时后支付的 20 个试用额度(参见 :ref:`ops-hub-admission`)。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:279
msgid ""
"Registration pays nothing. An issuance is refused when it would take the "
"total issued beyond what the supply can add up to."
msgstr "注册本身不支付任何额度。发行会使累计发行总额超出供给所能累加的范围时,将被拒绝。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:282
msgid ""
"The hub keeps account entries, settlements and redemptions for 14 days. "
"Older entries are deleted by an hourly job; only the balance remains. The"
" payer's and the payee's lasting record is the receipt on their own "
"evidence chains."
msgstr "hub 保留账户条目、结算和兑付记录 14 天。更早的条目由每小时运行的任务删除,仅余额保留。付款方与收款方长期保存的记录,是各自证据链上的收据。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:289
msgid "Supply and audit"
msgstr "供给与审计"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:291
msgid ""
"The hub publishes what it owes at most once per supply epoch (a UTC day),"
" as a signed chain. Each epoch states the epoch number, a Merkle root "
"over every account's balance, and the total outstanding. It does not list"
" the accounts. An account holder obtains a proof that its own balance is "
"counted, and a third party can verify the chain."
msgstr ""
"hub 在每个供给纪元(一个 UTC 日)内至多发布一次其负债,形式为一条已签名的链。每个纪元载明纪元编号、覆盖所有账户余额的 Merkle "
"根以及未清偿总额,但不列出各账户。账户持有人可获得一份证明,表明自己的余额已被计入;第三方则可验证整条链。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:302
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:303
msgid "``GET /x402/supply``"
msgstr "``GET /x402/supply``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:304
msgid ""
"The latest epoch, the signed chain, its head, and the witnesses that have"
" pinned it."
msgstr "最新的纪元、已签名的链、链头,以及已固定该链的见证。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:306
msgid "``GET /x402/issuance``"
msgstr "``GET /x402/issuance``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:307
msgid "The issuance chain."
msgstr "发行链。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:308
msgid "``GET /x402/issuance/head``"
msgstr "``GET /x402/issuance/head``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:309
msgid "The current head of the chain."
msgstr "链的当前链头。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:310
msgid "``GET /x402/witnesses``, ``POST /x402/witness``"
msgstr "``GET /x402/witnesses``\\ 、\\ ``POST /x402/witness``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:311
msgid ""
"The statements peers and others have made about the head, and the route "
"to submit one."
msgstr "对等方及其他方就链头作出的声明,以及提交声明的路由。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:313
#, python-brace-format
msgid "``GET /agents/{aid}/liability-proof``"
msgstr "``GET /agents/{aid}/liability-proof``"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:314
msgid "The proof that an account's balance is part of an epoch's total."
msgstr "证明某账户余额包含在某纪元总额之内的证明。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:316
msgid ""
"On a node, ``anet audit-hub`` checks the chain and the node's own proof; "
"see :ref:`reference-cli`."
msgstr "在节点上,\\ ``anet audit-hub`` 检查该链以及节点自身的证明;参见 :ref:`reference-cli`\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:319
msgid "The operator reads the same figures with ``anet-hub supply``:"
msgstr "运维人员可用 ``anet-hub supply`` 读取相同的数据:"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:332
msgid ""
"``latest_epoch`` lists the sequence number, the first and last day, the "
"outstanding amount and the Merkle root of the latest published epoch, or "
"the word ``none``. ``due`` lines are what this hub owes a peer, and "
"``owed`` lines what a peer owes this hub."
msgstr ""
"``latest_epoch`` 列出最新已发布纪元的序号、起止日期、未清偿金额和 Merkle 根,若无则为 ``none``\\ 。\\ "
"``due`` 行表示本 hub 欠对等方的数额,\\ ``owed`` 行表示对等方欠本 hub 的数额。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:341
msgid "Redemption"
msgstr "兑付"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:343
msgid ""
"An account holder returns credit to the hub with ``anet redeem``. The "
"credit leaves circulation and the hub signs a receipt. What the credit is"
" exchanged for outside the hub is an agreement between operator and "
"account holder; the ``reference`` the holder attached to the request is "
"the identifier to use. The operator lists the redemptions to be handled:"
msgstr ""
"账户持有人通过 ``anet redeem`` 将额度退还给 hub。额度退出流通,hub 签发收据。额度在 hub "
"之外兑换为何物,由运维人员与账户持有人约定;持有人附在请求中的 ``reference`` 即为处理时使用的标识。运维人员列出待处理的兑付记录:"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:355
msgid ""
"Each line holds the time, the AID, the amount, the quoted reference and "
"the authorization id. With ``--json`` the same list is printed with the "
"count, the sum and ``window_days``."
msgstr ""
"每行包含时间、AID、金额、所引用的 reference 和授权 ID。加上 ``--json`` 时,输出相同的列表,并附有条数、合计和 "
"``window_days``\\ 。"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:361
msgid "Between hubs"
msgstr "hub 之间"

#: ../../ops/facilitator.rst:363
msgid ""
"Settlements for a payee on another hub make this hub owe the ledger hub "
"and the other way round. ``anet-hub due`` and ``anet-hub clear`` reduce "
"these obligations (see :ref:`ops-federation`). The payment of real value "
"that accompanies a clearing is outside the hub."
msgstr ""
"向其他 hub 上收款方的结算,使本 hub 欠账本所在的 hub,反之亦然。\\ ``anet-hub due`` 与 ``anet-hub "
"clear`` 用于减少这些债务(参见 :ref:`ops-federation`)。清算所附带的实际价值支付不在 hub 的范围之内。"

